name pdfmarginpar
category Package
revision 23492
shortdesc Generate marginpar-equivalent PDF annotations
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides the \pdfmarginpar command which is similar
longdesc in spirit to \marginpar. However, it creates PDF annotations
longdesc which may be viewed with Adobe Reader in place of marginal
longdesc texts. Small icons indicate the in-text position where the
longdesc message originates, popups provide the messages themselves.
longdesc Thus bugfixes and other such communications are clearly visible
longdesc together when viewing the document, while the document itself
longdesc is not obscured.
runfiles size=2
